{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以西结书","commonName":"以西结书","title":"以西结书","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"b300d2a00ef4238c256f8a9d29bc0a1d295803bb4dc8e9a92c0dd26615335564","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1271},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["葡萄树的比喻"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“人子啊，葡萄木比林中其他木材更好吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["葡萄木有什么用呢？能用它制造挂钩挂东西吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["看啊，它只能用来当柴烧。如果火已经烧了它的两头，中间也烧黑了，它还有什么用呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["看啊，它完好无损的时候，尚且毫无用处，被火烧黑后岂不更没用了吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["所以，主耶和华说：我怎样把林中的葡萄树扔进火中当柴烧，也必照样丢弃耶路撒冷的居民。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我必严惩他们。他们纵然火里逃生，仍要被火烧灭。我严惩他们的时候，他们便知道我是耶和华。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我必使他们的土地荒凉，因为他们对我不忠。这是主耶和华说的。”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}